@baseUrl = http://localhost:3333

### FEAT-01 — health check (200, status ok + contractVersion)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### FEAT-01 — rota desconhecida (404 NOT_FOUND)
GET {{baseUrl}}/rota-que-nao-existe

### FEAT-03 — configuração em vigor (200 LabConfig; 404 com LAB_ENABLED=false)
GET {{baseUrl}}/lab/config

### FEAT-03 — ajuste parcial (200 LabConfig)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/lab/config
Content-Type: application/json

{ "actionPointsPerTurn": 4 }

### FEAT-03 — ajuste inválido (400 LAB_CONFIG_INVALID)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/lab/config
Content-Type: application/json

{ "actionPointsPerTurn": 0, "foo": 1 }

### FEAT-03 — restaurar padrões (200 LabConfig)
POST {{baseUrl}}/lab/config/reset
